      <Desc>THE ANNUAL SAN DIEGO PRIDE CELEBRATION IS THE LARGEST SINGLE-DAY CIVIC EVENT IN THE REGION THAT WELCOMES OVER 300,000 ATTENDEES AND OUR NON-PROFIT ORGANIZATION IS AMONG THE LARGEST PRIDE ORGANIZATIONS IN THE US. IN ADDITION TO OUR ANNUAL FESTIVITIES, SAN DIEGO LESBIAN GAY BISEXUAL TRANSGENDER PRIDE, INC. HAS DONATED MORE THAN $3 MILLION DOLLARS TO LGBTQ-SERVING NONPROFITS THROUGH OUR COMMUNITY GRANT PROGRAM AND RUNS MULTIPLE YEAR-ROUND ARTS, EDUCATION, ADVOCACY, AND COMMUNITY SERVICE PROGRAMS IN ADVANCEMENT OF OUR MISSION TO FOSTER PRIDE, EQUALITY, AND RESPECT FOR ALL LESBIAN, GAY, BISEXUAL, AND TRANSGENDER COMMUNITIES LOCALLY, NATIONALLY, AND GLOBALLY.</Desc>
      <ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
        <RevenueAmt>5450</RevenueAmt>
        <Desc>SAN DIEGO LESBIAN GAY BISEXUAL TRANSGENDER PRIDE, INC. CONTINUES TO BE ONE OF THE ONLY PRIDE ORGANIZATIONS IN THE U.S. WITH YEAR-ROUND PROGRAMS THAT EMPOWER, EDUCATE, AND ADVOCATE FOR THE LGBTQ COMMUNITY; ESPECIALLY THOSE LIVING AT THE INTERSECTIONS OF MULTIPLE MARGINALIZED IDENTITIES. THE PROGRAMMING THAT WE OFFER FOCUSES ON LGBTQ YOUTH, COMMUNITIES OF COLOR, PEOPLE WITH DISABILITIES, WOMEN, AND MILITARY MEMBERS AND VETERANS. WITH THE CONTINUED IMPACT OF THE COVID-19 PANDEMIC THROUGHOUT 2021, SAN DIEGO LESBIAN GAY BISEXUAL TRANSGENDER PRIDE, INC. BUILT UPON THE SUCCESS OF THE VIRTUAL PROGRAMMING WE CREATED IN 2020 AND, ONCE VACCINES BECAME AVAILABLE, EVOLVED A HYBRID MODEL OF PROGRAMMING; ALLOWING OUR COMMUNITY TO COME TOGETHER AGAIN IN SAFE SPACES WHILE ALSO INCLUDING THOSE NOT ABLE TO ATTEND IN PERSON. SAN DIEGO LESBIAN GAY BISEXUAL TRANSGENDER PRIDE, INC. CREATES DYNAMIC EVENTS AND YEAR-ROUND PROGRAMS THAT EMPOWER AND ENGAGE SAN DIEGO'S LGBTQIA+ COMMUNITY. SAN DIEGO LESBIAN GAY BISEXUAL TRANSGENDER PRIDE, INC. PLAYS A PIVOTAL ROLE AS A CENTER FOR SOCIAL COHESION, FOSTERING UNDERSTANDING AND PROMOTING EQUITABLE REPRESENTATION WITHIN THE LGBTQIA+ COMMUNITY. THROUGH ACTIVE ENGAGEMENT WITH BOTH LGBTQIA+ INDIVIDUALS AND ALLIES, SAN DIEGO LESBIAN GAY BISEXUAL TRANSGENDER PRIDE, INC. CONTRIBUTES TO THE OVERALL WELL-BEING AND RESILIENCE OF THE BROADER COMMUNITY. THE IMPACT OF SAN DIEGO LESBIAN GAY BISEXUAL TRANSGENDER PRIDE, INC. EXTENDS BEYOND SELF-IDENTIFICATION, ACKNOWLEDGING THE CRUCIAL ROLE OF ALLIES AND CULTIVATING AN INCLUSIVE ENVIRONMENT.</Desc>
      </ProgSrvcAccomActy2Grp>
